<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Air Duct Cleaning Charleston SC" description="Privacy policy for aairductcleaningcharlestonnc.com">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>How we handle information on this site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>This website (aairductcleaningcharlestonnc.com) is a static informational site. We do not operate user accounts or collect personal data through forms on this site.</p>
      <h2>Phone Calls</h2>
      <p>When you call the number listed on this site, any information you provide is used solely to schedule and perform service. We do not sell or share customer contact information with third parties for marketing.</p>
      <h2>Analytics &amp; Hosting</h2>
      <p>The site may be hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect standard technical logs (IP address, browser type, etc.) as part of delivering and securing the site. We do not use third-party advertising trackers on this site.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: call (843) 555-0199 or write to the business address at 775 Folly Rd d, Charleston, SC 29412.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
